UPDATE companies SET description='Virginia Panel Corporation (VPC) is headquartered in Waynesboro, Virginia.

VPC manufactures cable assemblies and interconnect solutions for test and measurement applications. The company also provides digital engineering tools such as a Wirelist Template for communicating project requirements, a Cable Solution Selector that matches PXI instruments with VPC receivers, and a Patchcord Designer supporting over 70 contact and patchcord combinations. These tools are intended to accelerate quoting, reduce errors, and lower labor costs.

The company serves customers in the automotive, aerospace, defense, medical, and telecommunications sectors. Its solutions are used in applications including hardware-in-the-loop (HIL) testing, ECU testing, signal conditioning, RF and microwave testing, and environmental testing. VPC’s interconnect products align with industry standards such as PXI, VXI, VDATS, and CASS.

