UPDATE companies SET description='Walker Woodworking was founded in 2000 in Shelby, North Carolina, by Travis Walker, beginning as a hobby and growing into a team of skilled craftsmen building one-of-a-kind cabinets. The company operates a 75,000-square-foot manufacturing facility in Shelby.

The shop produces custom cabinets, fine furniture, and luxury cabinetry for residential and commercial spaces. The facility also handles lighting installation and testing, though it does not warrant third-party electrical work. A service and repair department supports existing installations.

The company works with client-supplied extrusion samples and confirms machinability before production.

