UPDATE companies SET description='Wapsie Valley Creamery, a family-owned dairy processor, has operated in Independence, Iowa since 1906.

At its Independence plant, Wapsie manufactures cheese, lactose, and whey products, processing milk sourced from more than 170 independent dairy farms across eastern Iowa, southwestern Wisconsin, and northwestern Illinois. The facility employs approximately 140 people and has continually upgraded its equipment to increase throughput and improve yield.

The creamery sells its cheese in bulk to large wholesale companies that cut and shred it for private-label retail packages. Its lactose goes to food manufacturers for use in confectionery, sweeteners, and dairy blends, while reduced-lactose whey is supplied to wholesalers for processed cheeses, cheese spreads, and calf milk replacer.

Wapsie emphasizes a quality system that starts with farm-level inspections by state and federal agencies, supplemented by its own field staff and a dedicated quality-assurance laboratory. The company says its long history and ongoing investment in processing technology allow it to maintain consistent product standards despite its relatively small size in the industry.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Cheese manufacturing", "Lactose production", "Whey production", "Milk processing", "Quality assurance testing", "Laboratory testing", "Farm milk inspection coordination"], "industries": ["Dairy processing", "Food ingredient manufacturing", "Confectionery", "Animal feed"], "materials": ["Raw milk"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Continuous investment in new processing equipment to increase efficiency and yield", "Milk sourced from 170+ independent farms inspected by three government agencies", "Dedicated field staff monitoring and advising milk producers", "On-site quality-assurance laboratory with third-party testing for pathogens", "Family-owned operation with over a century of dairy experience"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1906 -> db", "Family-owned business -> /about-us", "Headquarters Independence, Iowa -> /about-us", "140 employees -> /about-us", "Processes milk from 170+ independent dairy farms -> /about-us", "Manufactures cheese, lactose, whey products -> /about-us", "Sells cheese to wholesale companies for private-label retail -> /about-us", "Lactose sold to food manufacturers for confectionery, sweeteners, dairy blends -> /about-us", "Reduced-lactose whey sold for processed cheeses, cheese spreads, calf milk replacer -> /about-us", "Continuous investment in new equipment for efficiency and yield -> /about-us", "Milk farms inspected by Iowa Public Health Dept, Iowa Dept of Agriculture, US Public Health Dept -> /quality", "Own field staff monitor and advise milk producers -> /quality", "Q