UPDATE companies SET description='Western Energy Systems, operating as Northeast-Western Energy Systems USA, LLC (NES-WES), is headquartered in Brea, California. The company traces its roots to 1964 and has accumulated over 50 years of experience in reciprocating engine power applications. In 2023, the business was acquired by the INNIO Group, adding the resources of the Jenbacher product line to its portfolio.

NES-WES functions as a distributor and systems integrator for combined heat and power (CHP) and distributed generation (DG) solutions. A staff of 200–499 employees handles integration engineering, field project management, commissioning, and ongoing maintenance.

