UPDATE companies SET description='Wilkins Lumber Co. Inc. operates a small family-owned sawmill in Milford, New Hampshire, a business that has been providing native wood products to the Souhegan Valley since 1808. The mill has survived the Great Depression, a fire, and a lightning strike in the early 1900s, remaining under family stewardship for over two centuries.

The company offers a log-to-lumber service that begins with selective harvesting for local timberland owners. Its sawmill processes New Hampshire hemlock and pine, turning every scrap into competitively priced lumber products. No facility size or headcount figures are disclosed.

The mill’s customer base is rooted in the Souhegan Valley and surrounding communities.

