UPDATE companies SET description='Williams & Clark Custom Woodworking (WCCW, Inc.) has operated as a family-owned shop in Frisco, Texas since 1988. The business was founded to serve commercial construction projects across the greater North Texas region with custom millwork and cabinetry.

