UPDATE companies SET description='Wire Belt Company of America operates from Bedford, New Hampshire, tracing its origins to 1919 when the Greer Company began manufacturing conveyors and belting. The business adopted the Wire Belt name in 1947 and has continued as a manufacturer of metal conveyor belts and conveyor systems with a global distribution network.

