UPDATE companies SET description='World Class Plastics Inc operates from Russells Point, Ohio. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

The company runs injection molding machines from 50 to 720 metric tons, heavily automated with Yushin multi-axis servos and Shinwa Aeroboy degating robots. An in-house tooling department handles maintenance, repair, design changes, and production support. Engineering and design are led by RJG Master Molder II certified engineers using SolidWorks. Automation extends to Yushin traverse robots, automated degating stations, and custom assembly stations. Quality is monitored in real time via a Synergy 2000 SPC system and RJG e-Dart pressure transducers, with inspection on an OGP Z600 video measuring system and a Mitutoyo CMM.

World Class Plastics serves appliance, automotive, aviation and aerospace, clips and fasteners, dental, electrical, multi-industry gears, industrial, and medical markets. It is a Worthington Industries certified supplier.

