UPDATE companies SET description='Wrabacon Inc. was founded in 1986 in Oakland, Maine, a region known for its craftsmanship. The company began with a focus on solving automation challenges through creative engineering.

The company designs and manufactures custom automated conveyor systems and equipment, including pick-and-place systems, accumulators, case packers, mergers and diverters, tray handling and stacking systems, and machine vision integration. Fabrication capabilities cover stainless steel, extruded aluminum, and painted steel, with every system fully assembled and tested before shipment.

Wrabacon serves the food, medical, pharmaceutical, automotive, sporting goods, and consumer products industries, providing automation solutions for some of the largest brands in the United States.

