UPDATE companies SET description='YellowLite was founded in 2009 in Cleveland, Ohio, by former executives from solar technology distribution companies who wanted to make solar energy more accessible to homeowners and businesses. The company began with a mission to democratize solar power and has since grown to operate three offices across the state.

The firm provides turnkey solar energy solutions, handling design, engineering, financing, permitting, installation, and performance monitoring for residential, commercial, and agricultural customers. Its NABCEP-certified team has completed over 4,000 installations across Ohio, Indiana, Michigan, and Pennsylvania. YellowLite also offers energy storage systems, solar leasing with zero down payment, and financing options that allow full system ownership.

The company serves the renewable energy sector, focusing on solar photovoltaic and battery storage projects for both small-scale and large-scale applications.

YellowLite differentiates itself through in-house installation crews, live project tracking for clients, and a performance guarantee that promises savings from day one. The founders'' original vision—to make solar technology mainstream—continues to drive its service model, which bundles design, financing, and maintenance under one roof.', certifications=ARRAY['NABCEP']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar system design and engineering", "Residential solar panel installation", "Commercial solar panel installation", "Agricultural solar panel installation", "Energy storage system installation", "Solar repair and maintenance", "Solar leasing programs", "Solar financing", "Site assessment", "Permitting and inspection", "Interconnection services", "Performance monitoring"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Commercial solar", "Agricultural solar", "Energy storage", "Renewable energy installation"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Over 4,000 installations completed since 2009", "lead_time": "4\u20138 weeks for full process; 1\u20133 days for installation after permits", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["NABCEP-certified installation team", "Turnkey design, financing, permitting, and installation", "$0-down solar leasing with maintenance included", "Live project tracking for clients", "Service across Ohio, Indiana, Michigan, and Pennsylvania"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2009 -> db, /about-us", "Headquarters in Cleveland, Ohio -> db, /", "Over 4,000 solar installations completed -> /", "NABCEP-certified team -> /", "Service coverage in Ohio, Indiana, Michigan, Pennsylvania -> /", "Offices in Cleveland, Columbus, Cincinnati -> /", "Turnkey services: design, financing, permitting, installation, monitoring -> /, /about-us", "Solar leasing with $0 down and maintenance included -> /", "Solar financing with ownership option -> /", "Installation takes 1-3 days after permits; full process 4-8 weeks -> /", "Founded by former solar distribution executives -> /abou